# ============================================================================
# THRIVE ORTHO EHR - Environment Variables
# ============================================================================
# Copy this file to .dev.vars and fill in your values for local development
# For production, use: npx wrangler secret put VARIABLE_NAME

# ============================================================================
# AI SERVICES (Optional - mock data used if not configured)
# ============================================================================

# Google Gemini API Key
# Get yours at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key

# OpenAI API Key (optional, for fallback)
# Get yours at: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key

# ============================================================================
# TWILIO SMS (Required for SMS notifications)
# ============================================================================
# Sign up at: https://www.twilio.com/try-twilio
# Free trial includes $15 credit (~2000 SMS messages)

# Your Twilio Account SID (starts with AC...)
# Found at: https://console.twilio.com/
TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=ACxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Your Twilio Auth Token
# Found at: https://console.twilio.com/
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=your_auth_token_here

# Your Twilio Phone Number (must be purchased or use trial number)
# Format: +1234567890
TWILIO_FROM_NUMBER=+1234567890

# ============================================================================
# RESEND EMAIL (Required for email notifications)
# ============================================================================
# Sign up at: https://resend.com
# Free tier: 3,000 emails/month, 100 emails/day

# Your Resend API Key
# Found at: https://resend.com/api-keys
RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# From email address (must be verified domain or use onboarding@resend.dev for testing)
# For production: verify your domain at https://resend.com/domains
RESEND_FROM_EMAIL=Thrive Ortho <onboarding@resend.dev>

# ============================================================================
# CLOUDFLARE R2 STORAGE (Required for video recording)
# ============================================================================
# R2 is configured in wrangler.jsonc, not here
# To create bucket: npx wrangler r2 bucket create thrive-ortho-videos
# 
# R2 Free tier includes:
# - 10 GB storage
# - 1 million Class A operations/month (writes)
# - 10 million Class B operations/month (reads)
# - Free egress (no bandwidth charges!)

# ============================================================================
# QUICK START GUIDE
# ============================================================================
#
# 1. TWILIO (SMS):
#    a. Go to https://www.twilio.com/try-twilio
#    b. Sign up for free trial ($15 credit)
#    c. Get a phone number from Console
#    d. Copy Account SID and Auth Token
#
# 2. RESEND (Email):
#    a. Go to https://resend.com
#    b. Sign up with GitHub/Google
#    c. Create API key
#    d. Use onboarding@resend.dev for testing
#    e. Verify your domain for production
#
# 3. R2 (Video Storage):
#    a. Already included with Cloudflare account
#    b. Run: npx wrangler r2 bucket create thrive-ortho-videos
#    c. Bucket binding is in wrangler.jsonc
#
# 4. GEMINI (AI):
#    a. Go to https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
#    b. Create API key (free tier available)
#
# ============================================================================
# PRODUCTION DEPLOYMENT
# ============================================================================
#
# Set secrets with wrangler:
#   npx wrangler secret put TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID
#   npx wrangler secret put TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN
#   npx wrangler secret put TWILIO_FROM_NUMBER
#   npx wrangler secret put RESEND_API_KEY
#   npx wrangler secret put RESEND_FROM_EMAIL
#   npx wrangler secret put GEMINI_API_KEY
#
# Create R2 bucket:
#   npx wrangler r2 bucket create thrive-ortho-videos
